"""Derive SkyyHud/build_skyyhud_0.3.32.py from the LIVE SkyyHud 0.3.31 (build_skyyhud_0.3.31.py = the tools/deploy_set.py SET pin, generated by
tools/hud_0_3_31_patch.py - never edit a generated script, edit this patch). Every anchor is asserted; at the end every change is undone on a
copy and compared with 0.3.31 (nothing else changed; tools/soundpass_gen.Patch). Line endings kept.
Run:  python tools/hud_0_3_32_patch.py   then   python SkyyHud/build_skyyhud_0.3.32.py   (never --deploy)
Check: python SkyyHud/test_skyyhud_0.3.32.py [--dir <folder inside tools/dev/scratch/>] [--keep]
"""
import os, sys

